  "comments": "<p>The variants mintmark on plate and mintmark on coin are reported for the years 1953, 1955, 1956 and 1957.</p><p>For 1953, 1955 and 1956 mintmark on shield is most common, and mintmark on coin is considered extremely rare.</p><p>For 1957 mintmark on coin (Brekke 106A) is more common, and mintmark on plate (Brekke 106B) is known to be uncommon.&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/642e95f252b25.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/642e95f252b25.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
